n《金文续编》(容庚,商务印书馆,1935)简称《金文续编》\\n《魏三字石经集录》(孙海波,1937)简称《三字石经》\\n《石刻篆文编》(商承祚,科学出版社,1957)简称《篆文编》\\n《说文解字》(中华书局,1963)简称《说文》\\n《汉印文字徵》(罗福颐,文物出版社,1978)简称《汉印徵》\\n《汉印文字徵补遗》(罗福颐,文物出版社,1982),简称《补遗》\\n《古封泥集成》(孙慰祖,上海书店,1996)简称《古封泥》\\n《秦汉金文汇编》(孙慰祖、徐谷甫,上海书店,1997)简称《秦汉金文》\\n《秦汉魏晋篆隶字形表》(徐中舒,四川辞书出版社,1985)简称《篆隶表》\\n《秦简文字编》(张世超、张玉春,日本京都中文出版社,1990)简称《秦文》\\n《睡虎地秦简文字编》(陈振裕、刘信芳,湖北人民出版社,1993)简称《睡乙》\\n《睡虎地秦简文字编》(张守中,文物出版社,1994)简称《睡甲》\\n《马王堆简帛文字编》(陈松长,文物出版社,2001)简称《马王堆》\\n《银雀山汉简文字编》(骈宇骞,文物出版社,2001)简称《银雀山》\\n《隶辨》(顾霭吉,中国书店,1982)\\n《隶篇·隶篇续·再续》(翟云升,中华书局,1985)\\n《隶韵》(刘球,中华书局,1989)\\n《隶书大字典》(洪钧陶,文物出版社,1991)简称《隶书典》\\n《隶字编》(洪钧陶,文物出版社,1996)\\n《古籀篇》(高田忠周,日本古籀篇刊行会,1925)\\n《金石大字典》(汪仁寿,1926)简称《金石典》\\n《四体大字典》(陈和祥,1926上海扫叶山房)\\n《汉语古文字字形表》(徐中舒,四川人民出版社,1981)简称《汉语字形表》\\n《古文字类编》(高明,中华书局,1986)简称《类编》\\n《甲金篆隶大字典》(徐无闻,四川辞书出版社,1991)简称《甲金篆》\\n《简牍帛书字典》(陈建贡、徐敏,上海书画出版社,1991)简称《简帛典》\\n3\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0011/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0011/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0011/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n13:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000013\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 13, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"3f9eebf0e9e7f9ff3370b1f735d8ca545fdf5cf3c667f86b1fc7658cf55c5143\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"cd52e409dc2e51a9cbc6954c4a3c2967677066b7dfa138c7a2c66228d3c3597c\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"一 元 天 丕 吏\\n\\n一部\\n\\n一 yī 影组、质部; 影组、质韵、於悉切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 商 [glyph:g002]² 西周 [glyph:g003]³ 春秋 [glyph:g004]⁴ 战国 [glyph:g005]⁷ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g006]⁸ 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g007]⁵ 《说文》古文 [glyph:g008]⁹ 汉\\n[glyph:g009]⁶ 战国 [glyph:g010]¹⁰ 汉\\n\\n1《甲文编》1页。2《金文编》1页。3、4《类编》1页。5、7《说文》7页。6《郭店》1页。8、9、10《篆隶表》1页。\\n\\n指事字。古文字一至四横划表示数字一至四,是原始记数符号。“一”字本义是表示最小的正整数。《玉篇·一部》:“一,王弼曰:一者,数之始也。”又表示序数,指第一。《书·洪范》:“五行:一日水,二日火,三日木,四日金,五日土。”春秋战国以后,“一”字又可写作“弌”或“弌”,累增“弋”或“戋”旁,就如同“二”字又可写作“弍”或“弍”和“三”字又可写作“弎”或“弍”一样,是一种繁化写法。后世这种繁化写法均被废弃。(白于蓝)\\n\\n元 yuán 疑组、元部; 疑组、元韵、愚袁切。\\n\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 商 [glyph:g012]² 商 [glyph:g013]³ 商 [glyph:g014]⁴ 西周 [glyph:g015]⁵ 春秋 [glyph:g016]⁶ 战国 [glyph:g017]⁷ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g018]⁸ 汉 元 楷书\\n\\n1、4《金文编》1页。2、5《类编》1页。3《甲文编》1页。6《战文编》1页。7《说文》7页。8《篆隶表》1页。\\n\\n指事字。与兀为一字。本义是人头。《尔雅·释诂下》:“元,首也。”《左传·僖公三十三年》:“狄人归其元,面如生。”《孟子·滕文公下》:“勇士不忘丧其元。”元皆训“首”。“元”字在商代已行用,始作“[glyph:g019]”,突出人头,正体现元字之本义。“[glyph:g020]”上面的一横划是由象征人头的圆点演化而来。又作“[glyph:g021]”,上面的一短横是装饰性笔画,起初并没有实在意义,后世却因短横之有无而分化为元、兀二字。(白于蓝)\\n\\n天 tiān 透组、真部; 透组、先韵、他前切。\\n\\n[glyph:g022]¹ 商 [glyph:g023]² 西周 [glyph:g024]⁴ 西周 [glyph:g025]⁶ 春秋 [glyph:g026]⁸ 战国 [glyph:g027]¹⁰ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g028]¹¹ 汉 天 楷书\\n[glyph:g029]³ 商 [glyph:g030]⁵ 西周 [glyph:g031]⁷ 春秋 [glyph:g032]⁹ 战国\\n\\n1、2、4、5《金文编》3页。3《甲文编》2页。6、7《类编》28页。8、9《战文编》2页。10《说文》7页。11《篆隶表》2页。\\n\\n象形字。本像人形,突出头部,以示人之顶颠。《说文》:“天,颠也。”即其本义。古代有天刑,为凿顶之刑。《易·睽》:“其人天且劓。”陆德明释文:“天,刺也。马融曰:‘削凿其额曰天。’”《集韵·先韵》:“天,刑名。剞凿其额曰天。”天字上部象征人头部分的圆点,后来变成一横画,又有在其上部再加一短横者,乃装饰性繁化符号,无实在意义。(白于蓝)\\n\\n丕 pī 滂组、之部; 滂组、之韵、敷悲切。\\n\\n[glyph:g033]¹ 商 [glyph:g034]² 西周 [glyph:g035]³ 春秋 [glyph:g036]⁴ 战国 [glyph:g037]⁶ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g038]⁸ 汉 不 楷书\\n[glyph:g039]⁵ 战国 [glyph:g040]⁷ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g041]⁹ 汉 丕 楷书\\n\\n1、3《类编》3页。2《金文编》5页。4、5《古字典》116页。6《说文》246页。7《说文》1页。8《篆隶表》837页。9《篆隶表》3页。\\n\\n指事字。丕、不原为一字,后分化。甲骨文“不”字作“[glyph:g042]”,像草木之根部,为“柎”之初文。《诗·小雅·常棣》:“鄂不韡韡。”郑玄笺:“不,当作柎。”《广雅·释言》:“柎,柢也。”《说文》:“柢,木根也。”甲骨文之“[glyph:g043]”字,在上面的一横表示地面,下部之“[glyph:g044]”表示树根。金文作“[glyph:g045]”,后代文字承袭之。或加赘笔作“[glyph:g046]”、“[glyph:g047]”,后者分化为“丕”字。丕字在早期典籍和金文中的字义是大。《说文》:“丕,大也。”《书·大禹谟》:“嘉乃丕绩。”孔传:“丕,大也。”墙盘铭文:“对扬天子不(丕)显休令。”“丕显”就是“大显”,意为大明。(白于蓝)\\n\\n吏 lì 来组、之部; 来组、志韵、力置切。\\n\\n1\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"商代古文字“一”，单横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周古文字“一”，单横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"春秋古文字“一”，单横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国古文字“一”，单横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“一”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“一”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文“一”（弋上加横）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代“弌”形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"战国古文字“弍/弌”异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"汉代“弍/弌”异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"商代金文“元”，人头上为圆圈\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"商代金文“元”，人头上为圆实点\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“元”，人形头顶加横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"西周金文“元”，人形头部二横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"春秋文字“元”，人形头上二横\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"战国文字“元”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“元”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“元”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0013/source.png\", \"source_bbox_x