 \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘祭’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘祭’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"早期甲骨文‘祭’字形，从又从肉无示旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘祭’字中演变之肉旁字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"春秋战国‘祭’字所从攴旁异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"春秋战国‘祭’字所从攴旁异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"甲骨文‘祀’字字形，商代\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"甲骨文‘祀’字字形，商代\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"金文‘祀’字字形，西周\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"金文‘祀’字带饰笔字形，西周\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"金文‘祀’字字形，春秋\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘祀’字字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘祀’字带饰笔字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘祀’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体‘祀’字，从示从禠省/禋省声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘祀’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"西周文字‘祀’字声旁‘巳’上所加饰笔符号\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘祀’字声旁‘巳’上所加饰笔符号\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"秦代‘祀’字异体小篆字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g027\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文‘柴’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘柴’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g029\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘衬’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘衬’字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0019/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n20:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000020\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 20, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"3033fb8437586d2c5d1f7cb3503ee813d456f0f88ba8d338fa2bb71f1266bc2c\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"296655174125906cfb196ced151efdb58c50e9c16dbdd21ace0f0588c23e227c\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"示部\\n\\n1《说文》8页。2《篆隶表》11页。\\n形声字。从示,付声。本义是一种祭名,新死之人附祭于先祖。《说文》:“祔,后死者合食于先祖。”《尔雅·释诂下》:“祔,祖也。”郭璞注:“祔,付也。付新死者于祖庙。”《释名·释丧制》:“祭曰祔。祭于祖庙,以后死孙祔于祖也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祖 zǔ 精组、鱼部;精组、姥韵、则古切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 商\\n[glyph:g002]² 西周\\n[glyph:g003]³ 春秋\\n[glyph:g004]⁴ 战国\\n[glyph:g005]⁵ 战国\\n[glyph:g006]⁶ 战国\\n[glyph:g007]⁷ 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g008]⁸ 汉\\n祖 楷书\\n\\n1《甲文编》9页。2、3《金文编》12、13页。4《楚系简帛》22页。5《战文编》7页。6《金文编》13页。7《说文》8页。8《篆隶表》11页。\\n形声字。从示,且声。甲骨文和西周金文中以“且”为“祖”,不从“示”。关于“且”字之造字本义,有多种说法,或云是男性生殖器之象形,或说是像神主之形,尚无定论。古文字中“祖”字是指祖先而言,凡父辈以上皆可称“祖”。《诗·大雅·生民序》:“《生民》,尊祖也。”孔颖达疏:“祖之定名,父之父耳。但祖者,始也,己所从始也,自父之父以上皆得称焉。”“祖”字应当是由“且”分化出来的专用字。后世“且”用为虚词,不再用来表示“祖先”之义。这种分化大概是在春秋时代完成的,所以春秋文字中“祖”字已作“[glyph:g009]”。战国文字在春秋文字的基础上发生一些变化,主要表现在声旁“且”字上,或加一短横为饰笔,或加“又”旁繁化,并在“且”旁右边加“[glyph:g010]”为饰笔;或将“且”声改为“䖈”声。秦汉以后的“祖”字基本沿袭春秋文字的写法,变化不大。参见“且”字条。(白于蓝)\\n\\n絭 bēng 帮组、阳部;帮组、庚韵、甫盲切。\\n\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 《说文》小篆\\n絭 楷书\\n[glyph:g012]² 《说文》或体\\n[glyph:g013] 楷书\\n\\n1、2《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,彭声。或作禓,从示,方声。始见于秦代文字。本义是指宗庙门内设祭之处。《说文》:“絭,门内祭先祖所以徬徨。从示,彭声。《诗》曰:‘祝祭于絭。’禓,絭或从方。”《诗·小雅·楚茨》:“祝祭于祊,祀事孔明。”毛传:“祊,门内也。”《左传·襄公二十四年》:“保始受氏,以守宗祊。”杜预注:“祊,庙门。”《礼记·郊特牲》:“索祭祝于祊。”孔颖达疏:“凡祊有二种:一是正祭之时,既设祭于庙,又求神于庙门之内……二是明日绎祭之时,设馔于庙门外西室,亦谓之祊。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祏 shí 禅组、铎部;禅组、昔韵、常只切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014]¹ 商\\n[glyph:g015]² 商\\n[glyph:g016]³ 《说文》小篆\\n祏 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》9页。2《说文》8页。\\n会意兼形声字。从示、从石,石亦声。始见于甲骨文。本义是指古代宗庙中藏神主的石匣。《说文》:“祏,宗庙主也。周礼有郊宗石室。”徐灏注笺:“宗庙主藏于石室,谓之宗祏。浑言之,则祏曰宗庙主,非谓祏即主也。”《玉篇·示部》:“祏,庙主石室也。”《左传·昭公十八年》:“使祝史徙主祏于周庙。”杜预注:“祏,庙主石函。”孔颖达疏:“每庙木主皆以石函盛之,当祭则出之,事毕则纳于函,藏于庙之北壁之内,所以辟火灾也。”甲骨文之“祏”均用作祭名,如《铁云藏龟》121.2:“[glyph:g017]亥卜,殻贞:祏南庚……”([glyph:g018]亥这一天占卜,由殻这个人贞问:是否祏祭南庚……)“南庚”是商王祖先名。(白于蓝)\\n\\n妣 bǐ 帮组、脂部;帮组、旨韵、卑履切。\\n\\n[glyph:g019]¹ 春秋\\n[glyph:g020]² 《说文》小篆\\n妣 楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》13页。2《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,比声。本义是指用小猪祭司命神。《说文》:“妣,以豚祠司命。从示,比声。《汉律》曰:‘祠妣司命。’”段玉裁注:“《风俗通义》曰:‘《周礼》司命,文昌也。今民间祀司命,刻木长尺二寸为人像,行者担箧中,居者别作小屋。齐地大尊重之,汝南余郡亦多有,皆祠以腊,率以春秋之月。’按,腊同猪,许所谓豚也。”春秋文字中的“妣”从“ [glyph:g021] (匕)”声。“匕”乃匕柶之象形,与“比”同音,故“妣”亦可从匕声。此“妣”字见于春秋金文齐铸当中,通借为“考妣”之“妣”,其文句是:“输保其身,用享用孝于皇祖圣叔、皇䣥(妣)圣妾,于皇祖又成惠叔、皇妣\\n\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“且”字形，柱状神主之形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周金文“且”字形，上下有横画托底与冠饰\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“祖”字形，左示右且\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国楚系文字“祖”字形，从示从䖈\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国文字“祖”字形，左示右且，且字上部加横笔与饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国金文“祖”字形，左示，右边且旁加又及饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祖”字形，左示右且\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书/篆隶“祖”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“祖”字形，文本中引用\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国金文祖字中添加的类似“公”或八形的饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“絭”字形，从示彭声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆或体“禓”字形，从示方声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"楷书“祊”字形，左示右方\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“祏”字形，示与石合文\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“祏”字形另一种异体，示与石合文\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“祏”字形，左示右石\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"卜辞干支缺字框（方框）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"卜辞干支缺字框（方框）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“妣”字形，左示右匕\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“妣”字形，左示右比\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"古文字“匕”形，匕柶之象形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0020/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n21:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000021\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 21, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"e0949c9b4fa2b89bd552706da4089c0053ef3c846e8b340daa32b4735912a093\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"578bc7c3d41ed77ca4facf6106f2f1d2ac6b0ac5c39d3ed0abf6c6d7b0cd958a\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"祖 祟 祐 祉 祠 禸 禘 祫 裸 祝\\n\\n(妣)又成惠姜、皇丂(考)逆中(仲)、皇母。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祠 cí 邪组、之部;邪组、之韵、似兹切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹ [glyph:g002]² [glyph:g003]³ 祠\\n春秋 战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1、2《汉语字形表》9页。3《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,司声。始见于春秋文字。本义是一种祭名,指春祭。《说文》:“祠,春祭曰祠,品物少,多文词也。从示,司声。仲春之月,祠不用牺牲,用圭璧及皮币。”《尔雅·释天》:“春祭曰祠。”引申之亦可泛指祭祀。《尔雅·释诂》:“祠,祭也。”《战国策·齐策二》:“楚有祠者。”高诱注:“祠,祭也。”禹邦玉壶:“以为祠器。”中山王圜壶:“雨(雩)祠先王。”“祠”字即用此义。(白于蓝)\\n\\n禸 yuè 喻组、药部;以组、药韵、以灼切。\\n[glyph:g004]³ 禴\\n汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g005]¹ [glyph:g006]² [glyph:g007]⁴ 禸\\n商 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《金文编》13页。2《说文》8页。3、4《篆隶表》12页。\\n形声字。从示,勺声。本义是一种祭名。夏、商两代春祭曰禸,周代夏祭曰禸。《说文》:“禸,夏祭也。”《礼记·王制》:“天子诸侯宗庙之祭,春曰祠,夏曰禸,秋曰尝,冬曰烝。”郑玄注:“此盖夏殷之祭名,周则改之,春曰祠,夏曰禸。”汉代文字中“禸”字开始出现从示侖声的异体。《尔雅·释天》:“夏祭曰禸。”陆德明释文:“本或作禴。”禴字亦一直沿用至今。(白于蓝)\\n\\n禘 dì 定组、锡韵;定组、霁韵、特计切。\\n[glyph:g008]¹ 禘\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,帝声。本义是一种祭名。《说文》:“禘,谛祭也。”段玉裁注:“禘有三,有时禘,有殷禘,有大禘。”大禘是指郊祭祭天。《诗·商颂·长发序》:“长发,大禘也。”郑玄笺:“大禘,郊祭天也。”孔颖达疏:“禘者,祭天之名。”殷禘是指宗庙五年一次的大祭。《尔雅·释天》:“禘,大祭也。”郭璞注:“五年一大祭。”时禘是宗庙四时祭之一。《礼记·王制》:“天子诸侯宗庙之祭,春曰祠,夏曰禘,秋曰尝,冬曰烝。”甲骨文中以“帝”假借为“禘”,如《京都大学人文科学研究所藏甲骨文字》2142:“于泞帝(禘),乎御羌方于止,气(灾)?”(“于泞帝(禘)”即指在泞这个地方举行禘祭)金文中则以“[glyph:g009](啻)”假借为“禘”,如刺鼎:“用牲于大室,啻(禘)邵(昭)王。”“啻”字在“帝”字之下增加了“[glyph:g010](口)”旁,是“帝”字的繁文。(白于蓝)\\n\\n祫 xiá 匣组、缉部;匣组、洽韵、侯来切。\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 祫\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。\\n会意兼形声字。从示,从合,合亦声。本义是一种祭名,三年举行一次的集合远近祖先神主的大型祭祀。《说文》:“祫,大合祭先祖亲疏远近也。”《春秋·文公二年》:“八月,丁卯,大事于庙。”《公羊传·文公二年》:“大事者何?大祫也。大祫者何?合祭也……毁庙之主,陈于大祖。未毁庙之主,皆升,合食于大祖。五年而再殷祭。”何休注:“殷,盛也。谓三年祫,五年禘。”《礼记·曾子问》:“祫祭于祖。”孔颖达疏:“祫,合祭。祖,大祖。三年一祫。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n裸 guàn 见组、元部;见组、换韵、古玩切。\\n[glyph:g012]¹ 裸\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》8页。\\n形声字。从示,果声。本义是一种祭名,酌酒灌地之礼。《说文》:“裸,灌祭也。”《书·洛诰》:“王入太室裸。”孔颖达疏:“王以圭瓒酌郁鬯之酒以献尸,尸受祭而灌于地,因奠不饮谓之裸。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n祝 zhù 章组、觉部;章组、屋韵、之六切。\\n[glyph:g013]¹\\n商\\n[glyph:g014]² [glyph:g015]³ [glyph:g016]⁴ [glyph:g017]⁵ [glyph:g018]⁶ [glyph:g019]⁷ [glyph:g020]⁸ 祝\\n商 西周 西周 春秋 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《甲文编》364页。2《甲文编》10页。3、4《金文编》13页。5《类编》175页。6《楚系简\\n9\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"春秋时代「祠」的古文字形，左示右司\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"战国时代「祠」的古文字形，左示右司\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「祠」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0021/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「禴」字，左示右侖\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-