nreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"艸部\\n\\n莊(庄) zhuāng 庄组、阳部;庄组、阳韵、侧羊切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—[glyph:g003]³—莊—庄\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《战文编》24页。2《说文》15页。3《篆隶表》29页。\\n形声字。从艸,壯声。本义指草盛貌。《玉篇·艸部》:\\n“庄,草盛兒。”亦可指庄重、庄严。《论语·为政》:“临之\\n以庄,则敬。”刘宝楠正义:“包曰:庄,严也。”还可指恭\\n敬。《玉篇·艸部》:“庄,敬也。”《集韵·阳韵》:“庄,恭\\n也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n蓏 luǒ 来组、歌部;来组、果韵、郎果切。\\n[glyph:g004]¹—[glyph:g005]²—蓏—蓏\\n战国 《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n1《楚系简帛》54页。2《说文》15页。\\n形声字。从艸,窳声。本义指草木的果实。《说文》:\\n“蓏,在木曰果,在地曰蓏。”《汉书·食货志》:“瓜瓠果\\n蓏,殖于疆易。”颜师古注:“应劭曰:‘木实曰果,草实曰\\n蓏。’张晏曰:‘有核曰果,无核曰蓏。’”(白于蓝)\\n\\n芝 zhī 章组、之部;章组、之韵、止而切。\\n[glyph:g006]¹—[glyph:g007]²—[glyph:g008]³—芝—芝\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《古玺》7页。2《说文》15页。3《篆隶表》30页。\\n形声字。从艸,之声。本义指灵芝,一种菌类植物。\\n《说文》:“芝,神艸也。”《尔雅·释草》:“茵,芝。”郭璞\\n注:“芝,一岁三华,瑞草。”又可指香草,也作“芷”。《孔\\n子家语·在厄》:“芝兰生于深林,不以无人而不芳。”《楚\\n辞·离骚》:“兰芷变而不芳兮,荃蕙化而为茅。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n莆 pú 帮组、鱼部;帮组、虞韵、方矩切。\\n[glyph:g009]¹—[glyph:g010]²—莆—莆\\n战国 《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n1《楚系简帛》55页。2《说文》15页。\\n形声字。从艸,甫声。本义指一种水草名,即蒲草。\\n《楚辞·天问》:“成播秬黍,莆藿是营。”洪兴祖补注:“莆,\\n疑即蒲字。蒲,水草,可以作席。”(白于蓝)\\n30\\n\\n萁 qí 群组、之部;群组、之韵、渠之切。\\njī 见组、之部;见组、之韵、居之切。\\n[glyph:g011]¹—[glyph:g012]²—萁—萁\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》15页。2《篆隶表》30页。\\n形声字。从艸,其声。本义指豆秆。《说文》:“萁,\\n豆茎也。”《汉书·杨恽传》:“种一顷豆,落而为萁。”这\\n种意义的“萁”今天读qí。“萁”字又指草名。《汉书·五\\n行志下》:“檿弧萁服,实亡周国。”颜师古注:“萁,草,\\n似荻而细,织之为服也。”这种意义的“萁”今天读jī。\\n(白于蓝)\\n\\n藿(藿) huò 晓组、铎部;晓组、铎韵、虚郭切。\\n[glyph:g013]¹ [glyph:g014]²—[glyph:g015]³—藿\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g016]⁴—[glyph:g017]—藿\\n战国 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《古玺》7页。2《说文》15页。3、4《篆隶表》30页。\\n形声字。从艸,霍声。本义是指豆叶。《说文》:“藿,尗\\n之少也。”徐灏注笺:“许云‘尗之少’者,亦谓豆之嫩叶可\\n食耳。”《广雅·释草》:“豆角谓之荚,其叶谓之藿。”亦是\\n一种香草名,即藿香。《广韵·铎韵》:“藿,香草。”“藿”\\n字战国文字作“[glyph:g013]”,从艸、霍声。因“霍”字或体可作“[glyph:g018]”,\\n故战国文字“藿”字亦可从“霍”声字。秦代文字作“[glyph:g014]”,从\\n艸、霍声。汉代文字有“[glyph:g015]”、“[glyph:g016]”两种写法。这两种写法\\n均见于后世典籍,但“藿”字更常见,而“[glyph:g019]”则很少使用。\\n今天简化字统一作“藿”。(白于蓝)\\n\\n莠 yǒu 喻组、幽部;以组、有韵、与久切。\\n[glyph:g020]¹—[glyph:g021]²—莠—莠\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》15页。2《篆隶表》31页。\\n形声字。从艸,秀声。本义是指狗尾草,是田间常见\\n杂草。《说文》:“莠,禾粟下生莠。”《孟子·尽心下》:“恶\\n莠,恐其乱苗也。”赵岐注:“莠之茎叶似苗。”明李时珍\\n《本草纲目·草部·狗尾草》:“莠草……穗形象狗尾,故俗\\n名狗尾。”引申之亦可指坏、恶之义。《诗·小雅·正月》:\\n“好言自口,莠言自口。”毛传:“莠,丑也。”郑玄笺:“善言\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘莊’，从艸从壯\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘莊’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘莊’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国楚系文字‘蓏’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘蓏’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国古玺文字‘芝’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘芝’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘芝’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"战国楚系文字‘莆’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘莆’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘萁’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘萁’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘藿’（1号），从艸从霍\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘藿’（2号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘藿’（3号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘[艸/霍之异体]’（4号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"楷书‘[艸/霍之异体]’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"文内提及的战国‘霍’字或体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"文内提及的异体‘藿’（即下部作[glyph:g018]的字形）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘莠’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘莠’\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0042/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n48:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000048\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 48, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"2451a0df3e192c88c7e79b4509a81705401d1eb2d369917b41d2b9ac75661f00\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"61d438cdf0ec3d613652532027ca8c496a959ba0e378b269f874f335cc462836\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"艸部\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹—蓷—蓷\\n《说文》小篆  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《说文》17页。\\n形声字。从艸,推声。本义是指一种草名,即“益母草”,又称“茺蔚”。《说文》:“蓷,萑也。”《尔雅·释草》:“萑,蓷也。”郭璞注:“今茺蔚也。叶似荏,方茎,白华(花),华(花)生节间,又名益母。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n萑 zhuī 章组、微部;章组、脂韵、职追切。\\n\\n[glyph:g002]¹\\n商\\n[glyph:g003]²\\n商\\n[glyph:g004]³—萑—萑\\n《说文》小篆  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》20页。3《说文》17页。\\n形声字。从艸,隹声。甲骨文“萑”字作“[glyph:g005]”、“[glyph:g006]”,古文字中“屮”、“木”在用为表义偏旁中时可互换,故“[glyph:g007]”从木。又古文字常单复无别,所以“[glyph:g008]”从四木,而“[glyph:g009]”从三屮。本义是指草多貌。《说文》:“萑,艸多兒。”又可指一种草名,同“蓷”,参前“蓷”字条。(白于蓝)\\n\\n鄀 jūn 见组、文部;见组、文韵、举云切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010]¹—[glyph:g011]²—鄀—鄀\\n战国 《说文》小篆  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《汉语字形表》21页。2《说文》18页。\\n形声字。从艸,君声。本义是指一种水藻名称。又称“牛藻”或“马藻”。《说文》:“鄀,牛藻也。”《尔雅·释草》:“鄀,牛藻。”郭璞注:“似藻,叶大,江东人呼为马藻。”《广韵·文韵》:“鄀,牛藻,菜也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n苴 yí 喻组、之部;以组、止韵、羊已切。\\n\\n[glyph:g012]¹—苴—苴\\n《说文》小篆  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《说文》18页。\\n形声字。从艸,吕声。本义是一种草名,称“芣莒”或“车前草”,“莒”亦作“苡”。《说文》:“莒,芣莒。一名马舄。”《尔雅·释草》:“芣莒,马舄。马舄,车前。”郭璞注:“今车前草,大叶长穗,好生道边,江东呼为虾蟆衣。”《诗·周南·芣莒》:“采采芣莒,薄言采之。”孔颖达疏引陆玑曰:“一名车前,一名当道,喜在牛迹中生,故曰车前、当道也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n藁(苞) qiū 影组、侯部;影组、虞韵、忆俱切。\\n\\n[glyph:g013]¹—[glyph:g014]²—藁—苞\\n《说文》小篆  汉  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《说文》18页。2《篆隶表》37页。\\n形声字。从艸,區声。本义是指一种草名。《说文》:“藁,艸也。”《玉篇·艸部》:“苞,乌苞也。”《尔雅·释草》:“茭,芄也。”郭璞注:“似苇而小,实中,江东呼为乌苞。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n蔗 zhè 章组、铎部;章组、祃韵、之夜切。\\n\\n[glyph:g015]¹—蔗—蔗\\n《说文》小篆  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《说文》18页。\\n形声字。从艸,庶声。本义是指一种植物名,即“甘蔗”。《说文》:“蔗,藷蔗也。”段玉裁注:“或作诸蔗或都蔗。藷、蔗二字叠韵也。或作竿蔗或干蔗,象其形也。或作甘蔗,谓其味也。”南朝梁元帝《谢东宫赉瓜启》:“味夺蔗浆,甘逾石蜜。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n茁 zhōng 端组、冬部;知组、东韵、陟弓切。\\nchóng 定组、冬部;澄组、东韵、直弓切。\\n\\n[glyph:g016]¹—[glyph:g017]²—[glyph:g018]³—茁—茁\\n西周 《说文》小篆  汉  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》34页。2《说文》18页。3《篆隶表》37页。\\n形声字。从艸,中声。本义是指一种草名。《说文》:“茁,艸也。”古文字单复无别。故西周文字中“[glyph:g019]”字从四“屮”。(白于蓝)\\n\\n葶 fū 滂组、幽部;敷组、虞韵、芳无切。\\n\\n[glyph:g020]¹—葶—葶\\n《说文》小篆  楷书  楷书\\n\\n1《说文》18页。\\n形声字。从艸,孚声。本义是指一种草名。《说文》:“葶,艸也。”张舜徽约注:“此草生湖地,色淡白,可以盖屋,湖、湘间平野亦多有之。茎似初生小芦,秋结实作穗如稗。农家多称为湖草,即葶草也。”又可借借为“稃”,指\\n\\n36\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“蓷”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“萑”字异体1，上从四木，下从隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“萑”字异体2，上从三屮，下从隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“萑”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“萑”字部件：四木下隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“萑”字部件：三屮下隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“萑”字部件：四木下隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“萑”字部件：四木下隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“萑”字部件：三屮下隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0048/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国文字“鄀”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/