 \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"正文中提及的西周从頁之稽字形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"字头，左斤右首下首（断/截首字，正体小篆字形的楷化或古文）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"战国文字第1例，从専从刂之𪭌\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"战国文字第2例，从専从刂之𪭌\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"战国文字第3例，从専从斤之字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"战国文字第4例，从専从斤之字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体，小篆，从専从刂\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0799/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书�\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
